# lib/fixtures/.gitignore
#
# Only the generated fixture JSON is gitignored. The seed, the generator
# script, and the tests are all committed.
#
# Why: the generator is deterministic (seeded RNG, constant seed 42),
# so the generated JSON is reproducible from the seed. Committing the
# generated JSON would create two sources of truth that can drift apart.
# Instead, the seed is the source of truth and the JSON is regenerated
# on every `npx next build` via the `prebuild` hook in package.json.

